# Fixture-based: fake prchecks/deploy/issuelog + fixture fork repo (bare origin
# + clone). Covers: full GREEN chain exit 0, gate RED exit 4, carrier RED exit
# 4, ship WAIT-TIMEOUT exit 8, ship rebase-gate exit 5, NON-FF exit 5,
# gated-sha/gated-run pre-verification, and (2026-09-11)
# journal-write failure = loud + non-fatal, working ledger path = quiet.
